{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And you shall make a menorah</b> — written seven times מנורה, corresponding to seven heavens and seven earths. And there is no letter samekh in the word מנורה, and likewise in the work of Creation (i.e., בראשית), to teach: in the place of the lamp there is no satan and no harm. And in the merit of 'a lamp of mitzvah and Torah is light' (Proverbs 6:23), the mouth of the satan is closed from inciting."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:24.846720107Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}